          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തങ്ങുക — taṅṅuka — \"to stay over; to halt\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "യാത്രയ്ക്കിടെ ഞങ്ങൾ ഒരു രാത്രി ബന്ധുവിന്റെ വീട്ടിൽ തങ്ങി. yātraykkiṭe ñaṅṅaḷ oru rātri bandhuvinṟe vīṭṭil taṅṅi. On the journey we stayed a night at a relative's house."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past: തങ്ങി, taṅṅi."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "താമസിക്കുക is to live somewhere; തങ്ങുക (taṅṅuka) is to stop for a short while on the way."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "തങ്ങുക (taṅṅuka) is native Dravidian, \"to stay, to stop, to rest\" (DEDR 3014)."
            }
          ]
        },
